<title>USA: Pfizer grants license to Roberts.</title>
<headline>Pfizer grants license to Roberts.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roberts Pharmaceutical Corp said Wednesday its wholly owned Roberts Laboratories unit had received an exclusive license from Pfizer Inc to develop and market Sampatrilat, a new compound to treat essential hypertension and congestive heart failure.</p>
<p>The agreement provides for transfer of data and assignment of patent rights to Roberts from Pfizer.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed.</p>
